Map<Character, Integer> freq = new HashMap<>();
for (char c : "banana".toCharArray())
    freq.merge(c, 1, Integer::sum);
// freq = {b=1, a=3, n=2}

// Fixed-array version - faster for lowercase letters only
int[] count = new int[26];
for (char c : "banana".toCharArray()) count[c - 'a']++;
// count['a'-'a']=3, count['b'-'a']=1, count['n'-'a']=2
```
`merge(c, 1, Integer::sum)` increments or initializes to 1 in one call.

